### P7: Brain — call-time `audio_ref` encoding, explicit omission rule, `capability_missing` for audio, token estimate, expiry and release (R4; AC16, AC17, AC14-tail)
- **Files:** [`modules/brain/__init__.py`, `tests/test_model_adapter.py`]
