plan (`P7`, `P8`, `P12`–`P17`, `P20`); the table below maps each one to the
step of this plan that answers it. A second review round — the challenger's
findings on *this* plan, numbered P1–P3 again and kept apart below as
"round 2" — is resolved in place in P4, P11, P13 and P16 (decisions 1 and 4,
